Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> start
Rule 1     start -> bloc
Rule 2     bloc -> instruction
Rule 3     bloc -> instruction bloc
Rule 4     instruction -> IDENTIFIANT EGAL expression POINT_VIRGULE
Rule 5     instruction -> PRINT LPAREN expression RPAREN POINT_VIRGULE
Rule 6     instruction -> IF LPAREN expression RPAREN LBRACE bloc RBRACE
Rule 7     instruction -> IF LPAREN expression RPAREN LBRACE bloc RBRACE ELSE LBRACE bloc RBRACE
Rule 8     instruction -> WHILE LPAREN expression RPAREN LBRACE bloc RBRACE
Rule 9     expression -> NOMBRE
Rule 10    expression -> IDENTIFIANT
Rule 11    expression -> expression PLUS expression
Rule 12    expression -> expression MOINS expression
Rule 13    expression -> expression FOIS expression
Rule 14    expression -> expression DIVISE expression
Rule 15    expression -> expression INFERIEUR expression
Rule 16    expression -> expression SUPERIEUR expression
Rule 17    expression -> expression EGAL_EGAL expression
Rule 18    affectation_simple -> IDENTIFIANT EGAL expression
Rule 19    instruction -> FOR LPAREN affectation_simple POINT_VIRGULE expression POINT_VIRGULE affectation_simple RPAREN LBRACE bloc RBRACE
Rule 20    expression -> MOINS expression
Rule 21    expression -> LPAREN expression RPAREN
Rule 22    instruction -> POINT_VIRGULE

Terminals, with rules where they appear

DIVISE               : 14
EGAL                 : 4 18
EGAL_EGAL            : 17
ELSE                 : 7
FOIS                 : 13
FOR                  : 19
IDENTIFIANT          : 4 10 18
IF                   : 6 7
INFERIEUR            : 15
LBRACE               : 6 7 7 8 19
LPAREN               : 5 6 7 8 19 21
MOINS                : 12 20
NOMBRE               : 9
PLUS                 : 11
POINT_VIRGULE        : 4 5 19 19 22
PRINT                : 5
RBRACE               : 6 7 7 8 19
RPAREN               : 5 6 7 8 19 21
SUPERIEUR            : 16
WHILE                : 8
error                : 

Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

affectation_simple   : 19 19
bloc                 : 1 3 6 7 7 8 19
expression           : 4 5 6 7 8 11 11 12 12 13 13 14 14 15 15 16 16 17 17 18 19 20 21
instruction          : 2 3
start                : 0

